[{"id":682468573,"node_id":"MDE3OlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0UmV2aWV3NjgyNDY4NTcz","user":{"login":"cure","id":149135,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTEzNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149135?u=093d6e46e315a2cff2f17765eaf43189919f1cd7&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure","html_url":"https://github.com/cure","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I think we're missing a .goreleaser.yml file in the repo. I propose one with these contents:\r\n\r\n```\r\nbuilds:\r\n  - main: cmd/headscale/headscale.go\r\n    mod_timestamp: '{{ .CommitTimestamp }}'\r\n    goarch:\r\n      - amd64\r\n      - arm64\r\n    goos:\r\n      - linux\r\n```\r\nOnly the line that sets `main` is strictly necessary. The `mod_timestamp` line is nice so that we make reproducible builds. The `goarch` and `goos` values are there to limit the number of targets we build for.\r\n\r\nI tested this in a dummy repo by playing around with `goreleaser --snapshot --skip-publish --rm-dist` and after setting a local tag, `goreleaser --skip-publish --rm-dist`.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/35#pullrequestreview-682468573","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/35","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/35#pullrequestreview